	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r2201_swplazmaw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あんたが　のぞむモノ
あたい　もってるわ！▼
でも　ほしけりゃ……
わかるでしょ？　しょうぶよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T05:44:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T10:32:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あんたが　望むモノ
あたい　持ってるわ！▼
でも　ほしけりゃ……
わかるでしょ？　勝負よ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-16T05:44:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T10:32:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀：White2ver
・アジト船：2回目
・メッセージ表示後、戦闘に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-11T06:06:51" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAW
プラズマ団♀・したっぱ１２</Text>
