	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r2201_baker_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしゃ　すきな　パンを　つくれて
まんぞく　してるけどさ▼
まいにち　パンと　みずだけで
みんな　だいじょうぶ　なのかね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T09:31:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T06:58:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしゃ　好きな　パンを　つくれて
満足してるけどさ▼
毎日　パンと　水だけで
みんな　大丈夫なのかね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T10:22:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T06:58:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T06:58:34" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BAKER</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-10T06:56:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r2201_baker_end_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たーんと　おたべ！▼
おなかが　すいてちゃ
だれも　あいせないからね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:50:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>たーんと　お食べ！▼
おなかが　すいてちゃ
だれも　愛せないからね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:54:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:50:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アジト船：クリア後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:39" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BAKER</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:36" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r2201_swplazmam_end_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アクロマさん▼
ポケモンを　だいじにすることで
のうりょくを　はっき　させるなら▽
ここに　いても　いいってさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:54:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アクロマさん▼
ポケモンを　大事にすることで
能力を　発揮させるなら▽
ここに　いても　いいってさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:54:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：クリア後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂・したっぱ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r2201_swplazmaw_end_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プラズマだんで　めいれい　されたこと
やっていれば　パンを　たべれたの……▼
じぶんで　かんがえなかったから
こう　なっちゃったのよね……▼
あー！　でも
この　パン　おいしーの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T05:32:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プラズマ団で　命令されたこと
やっていれば　パンを　食べれたの……▼
自分で　考えなかったから
こう　なっちゃったのよね……▼
あー！　でも
この　パン　おいしーの！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T05:32:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アジト船：クリア後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAW
プラズマ団♀・したっぱ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T10:49:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
